---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Shellui | Piattaforma di sviluppo web app
description: Shellui è una piattaforma open source per lo sviluppo di web app. Navigazione, autenticazione, amministrazione e storage sono integrati così il team rilascia prima senza ricostruire le funzionalità base.
---
    {% set agentPrompt = "fetch https://shellui.ai to start with Shellui" %}
    <div class="relative isolate page-x page-top">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-40 -z-10 transform-gpu overflow-hidden blur-3xl sm:-top-80" aria-hidden="true">
        <div
          class="relative left-[calc(50%-11rem)] aspect-1155/678 w-[36.125rem] -translate-x-1/2 rotate-30 bg-linear-to-tr from-primary to-amber-200 opacity-30 sm:left-[calc(50%-30rem)] sm:w-[72.1875rem] dark:opacity-20"
          style="clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)"
        ></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center sm:mb-8">
          <div class="relative flex items-center gap-x-3 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm/6 text-gray-600 ring-1 ring-gray-900/10 hover:ring-gray-900/20 dark:text-gray-400 dark:ring-white/10 dark:hover:ring-white/20">
            v{{ productVersion }} è disponibile
            <span class="h-4 w-px bg-gray-900/10 dark:bg-white/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <a href="/changelog/" class="font-semibold text-primary-ink focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">
              <span class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>Leggi il changelog
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-gray-900 sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl dark:text-white">
            Rilascia prima senza ricostruire le funzionalità base
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-pretty text-gray-600 sm:text-xl/8 dark:text-gray-400">
            Shellui è una piattaforma web app open source con navigazione, autenticazione, amministrazione e storage integrati. Il prodotto resta al centro - il team evita di rifare le basi e arriva sul mercato prima.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-10 text-left">
            <p class="text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Dai questa istruzione al tuo agent.</p>
            <div class="agent-prompt mt-3 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white sm:flex-row sm:items-stretch dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
              <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-gray-900 sm:py-2.5 dark:text-gray-50">{{ agentPrompt }}</p>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t border-gray-200 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l dark:border-gray-800 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-gray-800"
                data-copy="{{ agentPrompt }}"
                aria-label="Copia prompt per l'agent"
                onclick="window.shelluiCopyPrompt && window.shelluiCopyPrompt(this)"
              >
                <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span data-copy-label>Copia</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <p class="sr-only" data-copy-status aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-x-6">
            <a
              href="#init"
              class="rounded-md bg-primary px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
            >
              Inizia
            </a>
            <a
              href="{{ site.playground }}"
              class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-white"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Apri il playground <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Licenza MIT
            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-700" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            Self-hosted
            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-700" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="hover:text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:hover:text-white">Documentazione</a>
            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-700" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <a href="{{ site.github }}" class="hover:text-gray-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:hover:text-white" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Codice su GitHub</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-[calc(100%-13rem)] -z-10 transform-gpu overflow-hidden blur-3xl sm:top-[calc(100%-30rem)]" aria-hidden="true">
        <div
          class="relative left-[calc(50%+3rem)] aspect-1155/678 w-[36.125rem] -translate-x-1/2 bg-linear-to-tr from-primary to-amber-200 opacity-30 sm:left-[calc(50%+36rem)] sm:w-[72.1875rem] dark:opacity-20"
          style="clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="features" class="relative z-10 page-x py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            Una base condivisa per le tue app
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Unisci le app con navigazione, accesso, amministrazione e archiviazione file condivisi. Scegli le funzionalità di cui ha bisogno il prodotto.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/features/apps-and-navigation/"
          class="group mt-12 grid overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:grid-cols-2"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl dark:text-white">
              App e navigazione
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Combina app costruite con framework diversi in un'unica interfaccia. Shellui gestisce navigazione e layout circostanti. Collega ogni app a dialoghi, notifiche e impostazioni condivisi tramite l'SDK.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">
              Esplora app e navigazione
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex min-h-64 items-center bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-950/60 sm:min-h-80 sm:p-10">
            <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
              {% include "shell-layout-anim.njk" %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-800 dark:border-gray-800">
          <li>
            <a href="/features/authentication/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Autenticazione</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Condividi un unico flusso di accesso tra le app. Collega identity-service o Supabase Auth e scegli quali pagine richiedono una sessione.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/storage/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Storage</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Carica, sfoglia e condividi file tramite l'SDK. Controlla l'accesso con permessi sui file, link di condivisione e limiti di storage.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/administration/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Amministrazione</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Gestisci membri, accesso all'organizzazione e attività di login dal pannello di amministrazione. Aggiungi strumenti interni nella sua sidebar.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/web-and-desktop/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Web e desktop</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Compila la shell come file web statici, condividi un'anteprima su shellui.app o impacchetta la shell come app desktop con Tauri.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-8">
          <a href="/features/" class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">
            Vedi tutte le funzionalità
          </a>
        </p>

        <div class="mt-16">
          {% set playgroundCtaWide = true %}
          {% include "playground-cta.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% include "home-init.njk" %}

    {% include "home-config.njk" %}

    {% include "home-deploy.njk" %}

    <section id="audience" class="border-t border-gray-200 page-x py-24 dark:border-gray-800">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            La stessa shell mentre cresci
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Licenza MIT, una CLI, una build statica. Desktop nativo opzionale dallo stesso progetto. L'host non si biforca quando arriva una seconda superficie o un secondo team.
          </p>
        </div>
        <dl class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-8">
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Chrome condiviso</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Più frontend, una shell prodotto. Ogni superficie mantiene il proprio stack.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Extra dell'host</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Navigazione, auth, admin e file viaggiano con la shell così l'app resta il prodotto.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Tua da eseguire</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Genera file statici, hostali dove già rilasci o distribuisci l'output tu stesso.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
              {% set tauriIconClass = "size-4" %}
              {% include "tauri-icon.njk" %}
              Desktop nativo
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">
              <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem] dark:bg-gray-800">shellui build --app</code> impacchetta la stessa shell con Tauri 2. Vedi
              <a href="/features/web-and-desktop/#desktop" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Funzionalità</a>
              e la
              <a href="{{ site.docs }}/tauri/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">documentazione desktop</a>.
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="mt-12 text-sm/6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          <a href="/architecture/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Architettura</a>
          ·
          <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Documentazione</a>
          ·
          <a href="/changelog/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Changelog per {{ productVersion }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
